  "_comment": "Integrated parameters for run_pharaoh. One block per pair, named the way --pair names it: 'dapi-he', 'he-he', 'dapi-dapi', and 'he-dapi'. Only for dapi-he, stage3.n_tiles is the number of sampled tiles and Stage 7 scans all of them; stage4b.n_tiles is only the spatially uniform subset used for standout-nucleus detection in Stages 4/5. Stage 2 tries each detector in 'methods' until a fit passes its quality gate. stage4b.anchor_mode names the ladder run_pharaoh climbs: auto = nuclei pairs on the selected tiles, then top the tile supply up and try pairs again, then density (nuclear-architecture anchors) on every tile; nuclei_pairs and density each run their own level with top-ups only. A modality pair does not imply same or serial sections. Old correspondence_mode values same_section / serial_section are read as nuclei_pairs / density.",
